WEBVTT

01:27.905 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL MY QUEEN
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:55.625 --> 01:56.745
It's hot.

01:57.865 --> 01:58.705
I'm fine.

01:59.305 --> 02:00.625
You're still smiling after all this?

02:02.825 --> 02:05.185
You care about me. That makes me happy.

02:09.345 --> 02:10.185
Where's your medicine?

02:13.185 --> 02:14.025
I've stopped using it.

02:14.945 --> 02:16.105
Stopped using it?

02:17.385 --> 02:18.545
I mean,

02:19.425 --> 02:21.425
I don't need it anymore. I took it.

02:21.505 --> 02:23.505
You took it,
and you're still not getting better.

02:24.185 --> 02:27.105
I'm really fine. I just need some sleep.

02:33.465 --> 02:35.185
You have reached Jiangzhou.

02:35.745 --> 02:37.065
Why did you come back?

02:40.945 --> 02:42.625
Why did you trick me into leaving?

02:45.225 --> 02:46.545
To keep you safe.

02:48.745 --> 02:50.505
You're the Emperor.

02:50.585 --> 02:52.745
Your life is more important
than my safety.

02:52.825 --> 02:54.545
Yes, I'm the Emperor,

02:55.345 --> 02:56.745
but I'm also your husband.

03:17.865 --> 03:20.145
Even if I can become
the Empress of the Great Qi again,

03:21.505 --> 03:23.945
I can never be
the Ling Cangcang that Bai Chifan likes.

03:30.385 --> 03:31.865
You haven't answered me

03:32.625 --> 03:33.665
why you came back.

03:36.465 --> 03:38.305
I didn't want to bear the blame
for causing your death.

03:40.105 --> 03:41.105
But I think

03:41.905 --> 03:43.105
you came back
because you worried about me.

03:45.305 --> 03:46.145
I didn't.

03:54.065 --> 03:55.745
-What are you doing?
-Stay still.

03:56.465 --> 03:57.385
I'm cold.

03:58.545 --> 03:59.665
Let me warm up a little.

04:53.505 --> 04:54.705
We humbly welcome Your Majesties' arrival.

04:56.465 --> 04:57.465
I failed in my duties,

04:57.545 --> 04:59.985
putting both
Your Majesty and Her Majesty in danger.

05:00.065 --> 05:02.105
Please punish me.

05:06.705 --> 05:07.545
Xiao Huan.

05:08.705 --> 05:09.545
Xiao Huan?

05:12.065 --> 05:13.145
Xiao Huan!

05:15.505 --> 05:17.745
Xiao Huan! Xiao Huan!

05:18.465 --> 05:20.345
Guards! Summon the Imperial Preceptor.

05:27.465 --> 05:28.305
Cangcang.

05:29.185 --> 05:30.025
Cangcang.

05:30.105 --> 05:31.785
I'm here. I'm here.

05:32.465 --> 05:33.545
Don't leave me.

05:35.905 --> 05:36.945
I won't.

05:38.185 --> 05:39.225
I'll always be with you.

05:51.425 --> 05:53.905
-Your Majesty.
-Please rise. Examine His Majesty.

06:14.025 --> 06:15.545
It's worse than I expected.

06:30.345 --> 06:31.185
What is this?

06:31.985 --> 06:33.585
You didn't listen to me.

06:41.185 --> 06:42.705
To save Your Majesty as fast as possible,

06:43.305 --> 06:44.665
His Majesty took the Yushu Pill

06:45.265 --> 06:46.865
to force back the cold poison in his body.

06:51.185 --> 06:53.345
But the Yushu Pill is a poison itself.

06:54.065 --> 06:55.625
One cannot cure poison with poison.

06:58.425 --> 07:00.145
Now that the cold poison has recurred,

07:01.705 --> 07:03.025
his qi is obstructed throughout all organs

07:03.785 --> 07:05.745
and both his heart and lungs
have been harmed.

07:08.665 --> 07:09.945
Xiao Huan.

07:11.425 --> 07:13.145
What happened? Are you all right?

07:17.385 --> 07:18.785
-Your Majesty.
-Xiao Huan.

07:19.985 --> 07:21.345
-Xiao Huan. What's wrong?
-Your Majesty.

07:22.545 --> 07:23.385
Are you all right?

07:23.465 --> 07:24.625
Your Majesty.

07:24.705 --> 07:26.505
Don't scare me.

07:27.545 --> 07:29.585
Are you all right?
What's happening to him?

07:30.345 --> 07:31.665
What's wrong with him?

07:32.265 --> 07:33.105
His condition

07:35.545 --> 07:37.025
is extremely grave.

07:37.705 --> 07:40.945
No. Think of something. Quick!

07:41.025 --> 07:42.145
I told you before.

07:42.665 --> 07:45.945
Frost Reed is the only antidote for him.
He gave it to you.

07:47.545 --> 07:50.185
No. No.

07:50.265 --> 07:51.625
No, I don't want it.

07:53.105 --> 07:56.265
I don't want it.
I don't know any antidote.

07:59.345 --> 08:00.305
Xiao Huan.

08:04.385 --> 08:05.865
Xiao Huan!

08:05.945 --> 08:07.065
-Xiao Huan!
-Cangcang.

08:07.145 --> 08:08.625
-Cangcang.
-Wake up!

08:08.705 --> 08:09.545
Look at this.

08:13.025 --> 08:14.105
What is this?

08:14.185 --> 08:15.985
I went to an old shaman and begged
for this medicinal bath prescription.

08:16.065 --> 08:17.305
He once used this

08:17.385 --> 08:18.825
to save soldiers afflicted
with cold poison.

08:18.905 --> 08:20.305
Take a look. Will this work?

08:21.665 --> 08:22.705
Preceptor Du.

08:26.465 --> 08:27.305
This prescription

08:27.905 --> 08:29.385
does have its uses.

08:30.145 --> 08:31.585
But His Majesty's poison
has reached his lungs.

08:31.665 --> 08:32.505
I'm not sure if…

08:32.585 --> 08:34.705
There's no time. Hurry.

08:35.345 --> 08:36.865
-Try it.
-Guards!

08:37.705 --> 08:39.225
-Yes.
-Prepare a bath barrel.

08:39.305 --> 08:40.425
Boil the medicine
according to the prescription.

08:40.505 --> 08:41.345
Yes!

08:47.585 --> 08:48.585
Xiao Huan.

10:21.145 --> 10:21.985
Cangcang,

10:22.625 --> 10:24.905
I know you've misunderstood me
many times before.

10:25.465 --> 10:28.745
Will you give me a chance to start over?

10:30.625 --> 10:32.385
I'll stay by your side

10:32.985 --> 10:35.065
until the day you're willing
to walk toward me.

11:06.025 --> 11:08.825
POST STATION

11:16.985 --> 11:17.905
It's hot.

12:47.745 --> 12:48.905
The fever finally broke.

12:53.105 --> 12:53.985
Xiao Huan.

12:59.985 --> 13:00.865
Xiao Huan.

13:05.465 --> 13:06.345
Xiao Huan.

13:08.945 --> 13:09.985
Why hasn't he woken up yet?

13:19.225 --> 13:20.345
His heartbeat is fast.

13:23.745 --> 13:25.705
Did the poison reach his lungs?

13:28.985 --> 13:29.985
Xiao Huan.

13:30.065 --> 13:31.625
Don't scare me.

13:35.865 --> 13:38.105
Xiao Huan. Xiao Huan!

13:38.825 --> 13:40.465
Wake up, Xiao Huan!

13:40.545 --> 13:41.985
You can't die.

13:42.065 --> 13:44.585
Xiao Huan. I won't blame you anymore.

13:44.665 --> 13:47.425
I won't scold you anymore.
I won't resent you anymore.

13:47.505 --> 13:50.105
Wake up. You can't die. Xiao Huan!

13:50.185 --> 13:51.225
I'm not dead.

13:56.025 --> 13:57.505
You're awake.

13:58.545 --> 13:59.825
I'm fine.

14:00.705 --> 14:01.545
Really?

14:03.265 --> 14:04.105
Don't lie to me.

14:05.065 --> 14:06.985
Even if I had died,

14:07.065 --> 14:08.705
keeping you safe

14:08.785 --> 14:09.625
would've been worth it.

14:24.385 --> 14:26.385
POST STATION

14:26.465 --> 14:27.825
You've just started to recover.

14:27.905 --> 14:29.985
Make sure you don't catch a chill again.

14:32.625 --> 14:33.545
All right.

14:43.545 --> 14:44.465
Your Majesty, you're finally awake.

14:54.025 --> 14:55.425
I suddenly feel like
eating pear blossom honey.

14:56.305 --> 14:58.825
Great. Preceptor Du can check my pulse.

14:59.505 --> 15:00.785
Go get it for me.

15:05.625 --> 15:06.465
Sure.

15:10.465 --> 15:11.985
His Majesty's poisoned veins have eased
these past few days.

15:12.065 --> 15:13.545
Please examine him again, Preceptor Du.

15:35.705 --> 15:36.785
Do you know

15:37.825 --> 15:39.505
why I asked you to stay?

15:43.505 --> 15:44.345
I don't know, Your Majesty.

15:45.345 --> 15:46.265
Let me ask you.

15:47.105 --> 15:47.985
When Kumor forced you

15:48.665 --> 15:51.025
to choose between
the Phoenix Seal and the Empress,

15:51.105 --> 15:54.465
why did you take the Phoenix Seal
and leave the Empress behind?

16:05.065 --> 16:06.345
It was a lapse in judgment.

16:07.265 --> 16:08.225
Please punish me.

16:10.465 --> 16:12.305
We grew up together.

16:12.905 --> 16:14.585
Don't lie to me.

16:22.625 --> 16:24.585
Do you really want the truth?

16:26.025 --> 16:26.945
Of course.

16:34.105 --> 16:35.065
Because I think

16:35.145 --> 16:37.185
the Empress

16:37.265 --> 16:38.745
is a threat to you.

16:40.265 --> 16:42.345
-Du Tingxin!
-You're the Emperor.

16:42.425 --> 16:44.625
The entire Great Qi rests on you.

16:45.825 --> 16:46.905
But Ling Cangcang

16:47.865 --> 16:49.705
has dragged you into danger
again and again.

16:51.505 --> 16:52.345
I'd rather

16:53.065 --> 16:55.705
she never return to your side.

16:58.305 --> 16:59.705
Do you hear yourself?

17:03.025 --> 17:05.065
Everything I've done is for Great Qi

17:05.985 --> 17:07.224
and for Your Majesty.

17:08.625 --> 17:09.545
I

17:10.905 --> 17:12.665
-have no regrets.
-Du Tingxin!

17:18.345 --> 17:19.224
Your Majesty.

17:20.785 --> 17:21.665
Your Majesty.

17:23.825 --> 17:24.704
Preceptor Du,

17:25.944 --> 17:27.704
you've completed the peace negotiation.

17:28.464 --> 17:30.825
Leave the Phoenix Seal here
and return to the Capital at once.

17:37.025 --> 17:38.665
I'm worried about your health.

17:42.345 --> 17:44.105
I can't return to the Capital.

17:46.665 --> 17:48.265
The Empress is with me.

17:49.025 --> 17:49.865
That's enough.

17:55.585 --> 17:57.145
Your pulse is weak.

17:58.545 --> 18:00.425
You'll fall into longer sleeps

18:01.465 --> 18:02.785
from now on.

18:06.865 --> 18:08.945
Please consider your health

18:11.665 --> 18:13.345
and allow me to stay by your side.

18:14.745 --> 18:15.785
There are others in this world

18:16.505 --> 18:17.785
who can treat me,

18:18.705 --> 18:19.545
not just you.

18:21.265 --> 18:22.465
But my empress

18:23.185 --> 18:24.145
can only be Ling Cangcang.

18:24.945 --> 18:25.905
Your Majesty,

18:26.745 --> 18:28.345
you'd even throw your life away

18:29.985 --> 18:31.545
for Ling Cangcang?

18:33.705 --> 18:34.985
Is it worth it?

18:37.665 --> 18:40.505
Preceptor Du, this is not your concern.

18:41.705 --> 18:42.545
You may leave.

19:17.025 --> 19:17.905
Your Majesty.

19:20.665 --> 19:23.025
The grievances between
you and Her Majesty have lasted for years.

19:24.425 --> 19:25.985
Even if you've reconciled,

19:27.185 --> 19:28.865
how long can it really last?

19:30.905 --> 19:32.985
Do you truly believe

19:33.065 --> 19:34.305
that Ling Cangcang

19:35.305 --> 19:37.065
will stay by your side

19:37.145 --> 19:38.785
without resentment at all?

20:05.185 --> 20:07.305
Xiao Huan, look.

20:07.385 --> 20:08.785
Look what I brought you.

20:10.705 --> 20:11.745
You're sleeping?

20:13.465 --> 20:14.385
I'm just a little tired.

20:20.905 --> 20:22.505
You're tired now?

20:24.025 --> 20:26.105
It's late. Aren't you tired?

20:28.705 --> 20:29.745
I'm not.

20:30.905 --> 20:31.745
Look.

20:32.505 --> 20:34.665
The weather in Jiangzhou is so cold
that we can make ice lanterns now.

20:35.265 --> 20:36.985
I got a crystal lantern for you.

20:37.905 --> 20:38.945
Is it beautiful?

20:40.105 --> 20:41.545
It is.

20:41.625 --> 20:43.865
I'm thinking, once you get better,

20:43.945 --> 20:45.465
I'll take you to see ice lanterns.
How does that sound?

20:47.065 --> 20:47.905
Great.

20:55.945 --> 20:56.985
What's wrong?

20:58.665 --> 20:59.705
Nothing.

21:03.585 --> 21:05.865
I was just thinking,

21:05.945 --> 21:07.785
life here is harsher than in the palace.

21:08.385 --> 21:10.185
Maybe
we should return to the Capital soon.

21:12.345 --> 21:13.185
We?

21:14.785 --> 21:17.865
You mean you and I return together?

21:23.905 --> 21:25.465
Physician Li said

21:25.545 --> 21:28.225
a good mood helps my condition.

21:29.825 --> 21:31.345
What will make you happy?

21:32.265 --> 21:34.425
I'll tell you tomorrow.

21:37.025 --> 21:37.945
For now…

21:40.865 --> 21:41.905
For now,

21:41.985 --> 21:43.905
let's have a good rest.

21:47.945 --> 21:49.465
Your pulse is weak.

21:51.025 --> 21:52.945
You'll fall into longer sleeps

21:53.745 --> 21:55.305
from now on.

22:16.705 --> 22:18.225
Your Highness, we've reached Mount Xiandu.

22:34.785 --> 22:35.625
Your Highness,

22:36.225 --> 22:38.865
Physician Li is at the post station ahead.
Shall I go with you?

22:38.945 --> 22:39.865
No need.

22:41.825 --> 22:43.545
The incident in Xuzhou

22:44.345 --> 22:45.825
must be related to Ling Xuefeng.

22:47.465 --> 22:50.705
These guards may not all be trustworthy.

22:51.465 --> 22:54.025
Watch them closely.
No one is allowed to leave.

22:54.105 --> 22:55.585
Anyone who disobeys

22:56.545 --> 22:58.505
-will be punished under military law.
-Yes, Your Highness.

23:03.505 --> 23:06.385
Your Majesty, I'm leaving.

23:06.465 --> 23:07.785
Won't you see me off?

23:08.385 --> 23:09.665
From now on,

23:09.745 --> 23:11.585
you'll be the lord governing
your own land.

23:12.145 --> 23:13.825
Stop acting recklessly.

23:15.065 --> 23:16.065
Before I leave,

23:16.785 --> 23:18.185
I beg you

23:18.265 --> 23:20.305
to give me the map of Great Qi

23:21.425 --> 23:22.505
painted by Father.

23:24.225 --> 23:25.825
That's something he left behind.

23:26.585 --> 23:29.025
I want to keep it as a remembrance.

23:33.105 --> 23:34.465
That map

23:35.025 --> 23:37.065
records the lands, mountains, and rivers

23:37.145 --> 23:38.705
of Great Qi.

23:39.545 --> 23:41.025
Are you asking for it

23:41.105 --> 23:42.625
to tell me

23:43.265 --> 23:44.625
you still haven't given up the throne?

23:46.905 --> 23:48.065
Bear this in mind.

23:48.945 --> 23:50.345
As long as I'm alive,

23:51.225 --> 23:54.065
that map will never go to you.

23:57.425 --> 23:59.665
You may open this pouch

24:00.385 --> 24:01.585
when the time is right.

24:18.625 --> 24:21.265
All right. Stop trying.

24:21.945 --> 24:22.785
It's a dead knot.

24:22.865 --> 24:26.625
How dare you kidnap me?
Why are you tying me up?

24:27.625 --> 24:30.105
Don't think you can act outrageously

24:30.185 --> 24:32.745
just because His Majesty named you Regent.

24:32.825 --> 24:35.145
Li, be honest with me.

24:36.025 --> 24:37.585
Can His Majesty

24:38.665 --> 24:40.145
be cured?

24:42.345 --> 24:44.425
If he didn't know his days were numbered,

24:44.945 --> 24:46.585
why would he give me the map?

24:47.185 --> 24:48.265
The Frost Reed

24:48.345 --> 24:50.825
that could save his life has been used,

24:50.905 --> 24:54.625
but I have found a way
to replace it with Frost Blossom.

24:54.705 --> 24:58.345
With Frost Blossom, I can keep His Majesty
safe for at least ten more years.

24:59.705 --> 25:00.545
Really?

25:06.025 --> 25:07.425
If I find the Frost Blossom,

25:08.625 --> 25:09.545
Huan,

25:10.385 --> 25:13.025
your life will be in my hands.

25:31.585 --> 25:35.105
Frost Reed and Frost Blossom
come from the same origin,

25:35.185 --> 25:37.345
but they grow in different places,

25:37.425 --> 25:39.825
so their medicinal natures differ.

25:41.465 --> 25:44.345
Still, I've found a way

25:44.425 --> 25:47.265
to cure the cold poison
with Frost Blossom.

25:47.345 --> 25:49.185
It favors shade and cold,

25:49.265 --> 25:51.865
and mostly grows on cliffs.

25:51.945 --> 25:54.185
It withers within half a day.

25:54.265 --> 25:56.865
Bee-eaters nest in cliffside rocks.

25:57.585 --> 26:00.305
The males often carry
Frost Blossom while courting,

26:00.385 --> 26:03.305
dropping seeds
in their nests on the cliffs.

26:03.945 --> 26:07.905
Someone once saw bee-eaters on
the cliffs of Mount Xiandu.

26:08.585 --> 26:09.985
Follow the birds,

26:10.065 --> 26:13.305
and you may find Frost Blossom.

26:17.945 --> 26:21.585
Was Physician Li trying to fool me?

27:09.025 --> 27:09.865
Who's that?

27:41.785 --> 27:43.505
Well, well, Xiao Huan.

27:44.145 --> 27:46.665
Your life is in my hands now.

28:17.105 --> 28:18.025
Xiao Huan.

28:20.185 --> 28:23.145
If I die here,

28:23.225 --> 28:25.105
I'll haunt you even as a ghost.

28:46.585 --> 28:47.785
Why is it you?

29:11.945 --> 29:14.505
Didn't I set you free?

29:15.425 --> 29:16.385
Why did you come back?

29:27.225 --> 29:28.625
You spared me once,

29:28.705 --> 29:30.185
and I'm saving you now.

29:35.385 --> 29:36.745
We're even.

29:36.825 --> 29:38.385
I told you to leave, and you didn't.

29:39.185 --> 29:41.065
I've changed my mind now.

29:41.985 --> 29:43.185
I'm not letting you go.

29:45.345 --> 29:46.345
What do you mean?

29:46.425 --> 29:47.665
What do I mean?

29:48.625 --> 29:50.865
I can't just leave you on this mountain

29:50.945 --> 29:52.065
as wolves' food.

30:20.065 --> 30:21.185
Why did you save me?

30:24.665 --> 30:25.505
I didn't mean to save you.

30:26.905 --> 30:28.425
I just happened to run into you.

30:29.025 --> 30:30.505
Why are you still denying it now?

30:38.545 --> 30:39.385
Eat this.

30:39.465 --> 30:41.265
This is the Blood-Replenishing Pill.

30:41.345 --> 30:42.425
It'll help your wounds.

31:03.665 --> 31:05.625
Where are you heading to?
I'll give you a ride.

31:12.825 --> 31:14.625
Could it be you can't bear to leave me,

31:15.225 --> 31:17.665
and plan to cling to me for life?

31:28.305 --> 31:29.225
Wait.

31:29.305 --> 31:30.625
What… What's wrong?

31:31.825 --> 31:33.505
Why are you crying? No.

31:33.585 --> 31:36.425
I… I didn't mean that.
I'm not saying you can't follow me.

31:39.345 --> 31:40.865
I know you're injured,

31:41.465 --> 31:42.465
so I was worried…

31:43.745 --> 31:45.145
No. That's not what I meant.

31:46.905 --> 31:47.825
Master Zhong.

31:47.905 --> 31:50.145
Miss Zhong. Vice Sect Leader Zhong.

31:51.505 --> 31:52.545
It's my fault.

31:52.625 --> 31:55.305
I shouldn't have stabbed you.
I shouldn't have driven you away.

31:55.385 --> 31:57.625
It's all my fault. How about this?

31:58.225 --> 31:59.105
Here.

31:59.185 --> 32:01.465
You stab me too. Just not the face.

32:02.265 --> 32:04.785
Don't ruin my beautiful face.

32:05.905 --> 32:07.465
I don't want to!

32:07.545 --> 32:10.105
Uh. How about this?

32:10.185 --> 32:11.425
Hit me.

32:12.105 --> 32:13.065
Hit my face.

32:13.145 --> 32:14.065
Come on. Hit me.

32:15.105 --> 32:16.185
You see,

32:16.265 --> 32:18.825
no one has ever hit my face.

32:19.585 --> 32:22.345
You'll be the first and only. Hit me.

32:22.425 --> 32:23.825
Come on. Hit me.

32:23.905 --> 32:25.305
Go on. Hit me. Hit me.

32:48.785 --> 32:49.705
I'm crying

32:50.865 --> 32:51.865
because the world is so big,

32:53.185 --> 32:54.985
but I have nowhere to go.

32:55.585 --> 32:57.545
Didn't you always talk about
wanting to see Ling Cangcang?

32:58.145 --> 32:59.785
How would I face Cangcang?

33:00.625 --> 33:03.505
How would I explain to her?

33:03.585 --> 33:05.545
If you have something you can't tell her,

33:05.625 --> 33:07.185
you can tell me.

33:08.985 --> 33:09.825
Who are you really?

33:12.225 --> 33:13.905
I don't want to die
without knowing the truth.

33:25.585 --> 33:27.505
I was rescued by Master Li Lu

33:27.585 --> 33:30.105
from the Saintess of Lingbi Sect.

33:30.785 --> 33:32.225
After I left with him,

33:33.145 --> 33:34.505
he only gave me one task.

33:35.105 --> 33:37.305
No matter what happens,

33:37.385 --> 33:39.145
protect Cangcang.

33:39.665 --> 33:40.905
Even if it costs your life.

33:43.185 --> 33:45.465
-Master!
-Cangcang.

33:48.265 --> 33:51.585
Zhong Lin was an orphan
I picked up somewhere.

33:51.665 --> 33:52.545
I kept her with us.

33:53.145 --> 33:54.825
From now on, she'll stay by your side,

33:54.905 --> 33:56.425
-all right?
-All right.

33:57.185 --> 33:59.705
Don't be afraid.
I'll protect you from now on.

34:02.945 --> 34:04.425
I never harmed Cangcang,

34:05.705 --> 34:06.905
nor did I disobey my master.

34:06.985 --> 34:09.025
Before Master Li Lu died,

34:09.105 --> 34:11.304
he told me that from then on,

34:11.385 --> 34:13.065
I only had to obey Cangcang.

34:15.425 --> 34:16.264
I'm afraid…

34:16.865 --> 34:18.585
You failed me.

34:18.665 --> 34:20.625
What does this have to do
with Ling Cangcang?

34:20.705 --> 34:22.505
I didn't even blame you.

34:25.784 --> 34:26.985
Xiao Qianqing,

34:28.304 --> 34:29.465
I'm sorry.

34:31.225 --> 34:33.625
I killed you because it was
the order of Lingbi Sect's guardian.

34:33.705 --> 34:35.185
He came after you.

34:35.865 --> 34:38.545
If he still fails to kill you,
he won't stop.

34:39.145 --> 34:40.865
Lingbi Sect may be divided,

34:40.945 --> 34:44.665
but when it comes to killing,
they never leave a loose end.

34:47.744 --> 34:49.304
So,

34:49.385 --> 34:51.824
could you maybe shelter me for a while?

34:54.545 --> 34:56.385
I can protect you, after all.

34:59.145 --> 35:00.665
Forget it. You protect me?

35:00.745 --> 35:01.585
I think it's the other way around.

35:04.665 --> 35:07.185
Right. You protect me.

35:08.985 --> 35:11.985
Stop pulling the long face. It's ugly.

35:13.945 --> 35:15.705
Come on. Smile for me.

35:17.265 --> 35:19.785
Get off. I'm being serious.

35:22.105 --> 35:23.945
I'm going to Jiangzhou to find Xiao Huan.

35:24.545 --> 35:25.665
I'll take you to Ling Cangcang.

35:26.945 --> 35:28.625
If anything happens,

35:29.465 --> 35:30.385
I'll take the blame for you.

36:46.585 --> 36:49.545
NANRONG PALACE

37:23.585 --> 37:24.545
Preceptor Du,

37:25.265 --> 37:27.105
you've completed the peace negotiation.

37:27.865 --> 37:30.105
Leave the Phoenix Seal here
and return to the Capital at once.

37:31.145 --> 37:32.785
The Empress is with me.

37:33.625 --> 37:34.585
That's enough.

37:36.465 --> 37:37.465
There are others in this world

37:38.105 --> 37:39.705
who can treat me,

37:40.385 --> 37:41.825
not just you.

37:43.025 --> 37:44.305
But my empress

37:44.945 --> 37:46.345
can only be Ling Cangcang.

37:56.945 --> 37:59.465
Madam, General Lu requests an audience.

38:02.385 --> 38:03.225
Bring him in.

38:03.945 --> 38:04.825
Yes, Madam.

38:32.585 --> 38:33.625
Preceptor Du.

38:34.425 --> 38:35.345
General Lu,

38:36.225 --> 38:37.225
have a seat.

38:50.545 --> 38:51.505
What brings you here?

38:54.945 --> 38:56.345
Preceptor Du,

38:56.425 --> 38:57.705
after I return to the Capital,

38:57.785 --> 38:59.545
I must report to Commander Li

38:59.625 --> 39:01.545
on my mission to Jiangzhou.

39:02.705 --> 39:04.785
I came to ask for your guidance.

39:04.865 --> 39:06.985
You should speak honestly in the report.

39:07.065 --> 39:08.345
There's no need to come here
to ask about it.

39:19.545 --> 39:21.465
Along the journey,

39:22.265 --> 39:24.305
I had the honor

39:24.385 --> 39:25.985
to accompany you.

39:28.265 --> 39:30.585
I will remember what I saw and heard
for the rest of my life.

39:33.385 --> 39:34.665
I know

39:34.745 --> 39:36.745
you bear heavy duties

39:36.825 --> 39:37.905
and great burdens.

39:39.505 --> 39:42.145
It will be my honor to serve you
in any small way.

39:58.985 --> 40:00.105
General Lu.

40:01.385 --> 40:02.505
Yes, Madam.

40:03.145 --> 40:06.945
Do you mean the meaning of "Nanrong"?

40:11.705 --> 40:12.905
I do not, Madam.

40:14.585 --> 40:15.945
"Loyal to the Divine.

40:16.545 --> 40:17.585
If tainted by mortal desire,

40:18.785 --> 40:20.385
Heaven and Earth will not tolerate it."

40:30.905 --> 40:31.985
I understand now.

40:33.305 --> 40:36.065
Then I won't disturb
your peace any further, Madam.

40:36.665 --> 40:37.865
I'll take my leave.

40:42.305 --> 40:43.385
Hold on.

40:50.985 --> 40:52.425
I see by your complexion

40:52.505 --> 40:54.225
that you're sleeping lightly
and dreaming much.

40:55.225 --> 40:56.145
I'll have a palace maid

40:56.225 --> 40:58.665
fetch some incense
and tonic pills for you.

40:59.305 --> 41:00.225
You may come here

41:00.905 --> 41:02.465
to collect them every month.

41:05.985 --> 41:06.945
Thank you, Madam.

41:24.705 --> 41:25.585
Madam,

41:26.825 --> 41:29.425
restrain yourself.
Don't indulge wild thoughts.

41:46.945 --> 41:48.385
KUMOR ARMY HAS WITHDRAWN.
JIANGZHOU WON.

41:48.465 --> 41:49.745
I SPECIALLY SENT YOU THIS NOTE,
FATHER. CANGCANG IS SAFE AND WELL.

41:49.825 --> 41:51.025
SHE'LL SOON RETURN WITH THE EMPEROR.
PLEASE TAKE CARE OF YOURSELF, FATHER

41:51.105 --> 41:52.345
FROM JUEDING

41:55.545 --> 41:56.945
-Butler.
-Yes, My Lord.

41:57.025 --> 42:00.585
Give Chongming Temple
one thousand liang for merit lamps.

42:01.265 --> 42:04.305
Also,
give one liang of silver to every servant.

42:05.785 --> 42:08.065
If they wish to go home,
grant them permission.

42:08.745 --> 42:09.585
My Lord,

42:10.345 --> 42:12.905
what has you in such high spirits?

42:13.505 --> 42:15.265
Jiangzhou won the battle.

42:16.065 --> 42:20.465
Jueding and Cangcang are safe.
Shouldn't we celebrate?

42:20.545 --> 42:21.865
-Yes.
-Also,

42:21.945 --> 42:24.105
contact the people of Jiangzhou.

42:24.185 --> 42:25.825
Watch the two siblings closely

42:25.905 --> 42:28.585
and report all of their movements
and every word

42:29.585 --> 42:32.025
-they speak to the Emperor.
-Yes, My Lord.

42:32.105 --> 42:32.985
You may leave.

42:38.905 --> 42:41.265
Very well. Excellent.

42:41.345 --> 42:44.665
BRUSH AND INK

42:44.745 --> 42:45.705
My Lord,

42:46.305 --> 42:47.705
I've failed your trust.

42:48.465 --> 42:50.225
I couldn't kill
the Prince of Yuzhang in Xuzhou.

42:50.305 --> 42:52.065
Please punish me,

42:52.145 --> 42:53.425
My Lord.

42:58.465 --> 43:01.505
Xiao Qianqing is a hard nut.

43:03.425 --> 43:05.465
There aren't many opportunities
to kill him.

43:06.225 --> 43:09.465
There's somewhere I need to be.
You don't have to follow me.

43:12.425 --> 43:14.865
Stay here and think carefully

43:16.025 --> 43:18.225
about how you fall short

43:19.265 --> 43:20.105
of Xianxue.
